; The one variable: the z_index of a Control scene tile root (1) in a y-sorted TileMapLayer. The root
; is a canvas item child of the layer, so it sorts in z bucket 1 (renderer_canvas_cull.cpp:143-148)
; and draws over the red child although the child's y (40) is below the root's (32). The other scene
; tile goldens put no z_index on a root.

